        "node_id": "n_3_e443f5",
        "thought_text": "Instead of trying to modify each cell individually, consider systematically changing cells in a way that maximizes the number of equal elements in rows, columns, and blocks. This approach may be more efficient and less likely to miss a valid solution.",
